APPLICATION AND THIRD-PARTY DATA NOTICE
----------------------------------------
Mazkiplay Trade is an analysis, market-data, journaling, and paper/manual
trade-planning application. It is not financial advice and does not guarantee
profit, execution, liquidity, price accuracy, or availability of any provider.
Users remain responsible for every trading decision and must independently
verify prices, spreads, fees, contract specifications, and broker rules.

Market data, news, chart content, QRIS/payment imagery, video, and calendar
content may be provided by third-party services, including TradingView,
Indodax, Tokocrypto-compatible public endpoints, CoinGecko, Yahoo Finance,
RSS publishers, YouTube, and public calendar providers. Each provider retains
its own terms, copyrights, rate limits, and redistribution restrictions.
Only public read-only market endpoints are used by the default application;
private account APIs, wallet keys, broker execution, and DEX execution are
not granted by this license and require separate authorization and secure
server-side integration.

The QRIS asset is supplied by the project owner for the donation screen and
must not be repurposed as a payment credential outside the owner's intended
use.
